%% Turn-time retrieval flow, T3 (rag-retrieval.md §7.1)
flowchart TD
    A["RetrievalRequest"] --> B["1 Validate<br/>schema, IDs, pinned versions, filters"]
    B -->|invalid| S1["RetrievalStop: invalid_request"]
    B --> C{"2 Gatekeeper<br/>scope · readiness · source class · purpose"}
    C -->|ambiguous scope| S2["RetrievalStop: needs_clarification"]
    C -->|not ready / snapshot retired| S3["RetrievalStop: course_not_ready / version_mismatch"]
    C -->|source class absent / reference-only| N0["GroundingBundle: no_support_found<br/>+ source_class_unavailable / reference_only"]
    C -->|proceed| D["3 Query plan<br/>evidence needs · terms · notation normalization"]
    D --> E["4 Candidate generation inside eligible snapshot<br/>lexical + semantic; filters applied in search"]
    E -->|index / encoder fault| F1["GroundingBundle: failed (retryable)"]
    E --> G["5 Selector<br/>fuse · dedupe · cover needs · diversify · expand · budget<br/>optional reranker → fallback on error"]
    G --> H["6 Resolve<br/>exact text = ingested lines · page · highlight route"]
    H --> I["7 Sufficiency per need<br/>pinned · anchor · optional judge"]
    I --> J1["supported"]
    I --> J2["partial + uncovered_needs"]
    I --> J3["no_support_found"]
    B -.-> R[("RetrievalReport<br/>diagnostics only")]
    C -.-> R
    E -.-> R
    G -.-> R
    I -.-> R
